ent with the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173).</p></div></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Terms of Service</summary><p class="updated-text">Last updated: <?php echo date('F Y'); ?></p><div class="legal-inline"><h4>Using the portal</h4><p>Residents and authorized users are expected to provide accurate information and use the system responsibly for maintenance, billing, amenity booking, and communication.</p><h4>Account approval</h4><p>Full access to the portal is granted after PMO review and unit assignment when required.</p><h4>Operational precedence</h4><p>Official notices, PMO-issued statements, and management records take precedence in case of discrepancies between printed documents and portal content.</p></div></details></div></article></div></div></section>
